flowchart TD
  HUMAN[Human / qualified reviewer] -->|signed approval| GATE[Independent evidence & mode gate]
  CONTRACT[Requirements + hazards + signed build config] --> GATE
  SENSORS[Encoders / IMU / F-T / camera] --> EST[State estimation]
  EST --> CLASSICAL[Conventional planning + WBC + MPC]
  EST --> EFMW[EFMW optional memory / coherence monitor]
  EFMW -->|telemetry and conservative advice only| GATE
  CLASSICAL -->|candidate commands| GATE
  GATE -->|authorized joint goals only| DRIVER[Deterministic servo / ros2_control]
  DRIVER --> MOTORS[32 joints / actuators]
  SAFETY[Physically independent E-stop / safety system] -->|hardware inhibit| MOTORS
  ASSEMBLY[Recursive assembly proposer] -->|proposals only| HUMAN
  LOG[Source / measurement / replay ledger] --> ASSEMBLY
  LOG --> EFMW
  GATE --> LOG
